@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName "Noto Sans CJK SC"
skinparam shadowing false
hide footbox

actor "用户" as User
participant "voimed\nIM + grab + VK" as Daemon
participant "Hyprland" as Compositor
participant "系统剪贴板" as Clip
participant "XWayland\nX server" as Xwayland
participant "XWayland 应用" as App

User -> Compositor : 按下 / 松开 PTT 组合键
Compositor -> Daemon : grab key（IM 消费）
Daemon -> Daemon : ASR + 标点 → Final
Daemon -> Compositor : 查询 activewindow
Compositor --> Daemon : class / xwayland=true
Daemon -> Clip : set_text(final)
Daemon -> Compositor : VK 发送 Ctrl+V\n（终端 Ctrl+Shift+V）
Compositor -> App : 转发粘贴按键
alt VK 粘贴失败
  Daemon -> Xwayland : XTest Ctrl+V
  Xwayland -> App : 粘贴按键
end
App -> Clip : 读取剪贴板
App -> App : 在光标处插入文本
@enduml
